WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:02.420
Jake: Today, something very special happens.

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.420
It is the finale of the Sam and Niko channel 2016,

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:06.920
And in this episode,

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:09.500
One unlucky person will have to shave.

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:10.960
Will it be Ben or Brett?

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:13.000
I don't know but theres been a lot of feuding, theres been a lot of talk.

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:14.820
We're gonna do a beard off, the loser has to shave.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.860
It's real, neither of them want to

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.380
but one of them will

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.100
