00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:38.500
Jake: Oh, its fierce

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:39.700
Alex: It's very even

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:41.360
Jake: It's a dad match!

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:43.200
Jake: Brett's got the-

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:45.480
Jake: Brett's got the muscle but Ben's got the length

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:46.580
Brett: *struggling* shut up!

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:48.620
*misc yelling*

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:50.200
*nerf gun is force pulled by sheer muscle strength*

00:00:53.220 --> 00:00:54.300
Nick: What are you workin' on Brett?

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.800
Brett: Aw, man just gettin the Darth Santa costume laid out for the shoot

00:00:59.120 --> 00:01:01.160
Jake: You know how I played Darth Santa last year?

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:02.820
Brett: Yeah

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:05.440
Jake: Well, i'd like you to play it this year

00:01:05.840 --> 00:01:06.460
