00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:08.960
Well this is a pretty big promotion for you, quite frankly

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:10.120
Jake: You're gonna look like a badass

00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:11.100
Brett: Hell yeah, son!

00:01:11.140 --> 00:01:12.420
I'd be down for that

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:14.700
Jake: Alright, i'll see ya

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:16.360
Brett: Okay. catch you later

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.940
Jake: Today we are shooting Darth Santa Strikes Back,

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:21.800
We're gonna have Kylo Ren team up with Darth Santa

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.200
And they're gonna go around and you know, do what they do best, which is destroy Christmas

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.220
for everyone else

00:01:26.220 --> 00:01:28.340
I had Brett play Darth Santa today, and

00:01:28.340 --> 00:01:30.240
i'm really happy that he's liking it because

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.820
I didnt wanna tell him that it really sucks being in the costume

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.780
but it seems like he's actually enjoying it which is great for me, great for him,

00:01:37.780 --> 00:01:38.820
you know? Everyone wins.

00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:41.060
Brett: Some rough stuff, son

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:43.940
some rough stuff

00:01:44.840 --> 00:01:47.340
so much fun, i'm havin too much fun

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:50.380
*hype intensifies*

00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.940
Brett: *still struggling* dude, your face is touchin' the table

00:02:01.700 --> 00:02:03.340
Brett: I don't think this is either

